# Same-screen fades (D-278): a script that fades to black (or white) and back without leaving the map must bring the
# screen back exactly as it was – under weather (Petalburg Woods: shade; Cave of Origin B1F: horizontal fog) and the
# day/night tint (Rustboro outdoors; the emulator's clock is the host's). Each case shoots before and after
# Debug_EventScript_DraconidTestFade(White) (data/scripts/debug.inc) via "callscript" (debug builds). Compare the
# pairs: tools/hack/emu/fade_check.py <out dir> (mean brightness per pair; they must match).
# Needs rustboro_done.ss from tests/rustboro.play in the same output directory.
loadstate rustboro_done.ss
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
# --- Petalburg Woods: WEATHER_SHADE
warp MAP_PETALBURG_WOODS 26 26
run 240
shot fade_woods_before
callscript Debug_EventScript_DraconidTestFade
run 240
shot fade_woods_after
callscript Debug_EventScript_DraconidTestFadeWhite
run 240
shot fade_woods_after_white
# --- Rustboro: no weather, the day/night tint
warp MAP_RUSTBORO_CITY 13 57
run 240
shot fade_rustboro_before
callscript Debug_EventScript_DraconidTestFade
run 240
shot fade_rustboro_after
# --- Cave of Origin B1F: WEATHER_FOG_HORIZONTAL (alpha-blended)
warp MAP_CAVE_OF_ORIGIN_B1F 9 4
run 240
shot fade_fog_before
callscript Debug_EventScript_DraconidTestFade
run 240
shot fade_fog_after
